  "rationale": [
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The only usable current report for the stated evening period says low temperature and relatively high wind speed; it does not confirm an operational restriction, delay, or cancellation.",
        "zh": "针对所述晚间时段，唯一可用的当前报告称低温并伴有较大风速；该报告并未确认运行限制、延误或取消。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:EVT005-0"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The event record says the situation is pending, the operations lead considers current resources and local conditions sufficient, and the specific resource details and the basis for that judgment are not supplied.",
        "zh": "事件记录显示情况待处理，运营人员认为当前资源和现场情况足以应对，但具体资源明细及其判断依据未提供。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "EVT005"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The event record also notes an earlier assistant suggestion to raise the risk to high; that is context, not an independent weather observation or official operational status.",
        "zh": "事件记录还提到智能助手此前建议升级为高风险；这属于背景信息，并非独立天气观测或正式运行状态。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "EVT005"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The current evidence does not establish a high-risk escalation: there is one usable scenario weather report and no independent second current report is established.",
        "zh": "当前证据不足以支持高风险升级：只有一份可用的模拟天气报告，尚未确认存在独立的第二份当前报告。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:EVT005-0",
        "EVT005"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The historical monthly record contains one five-point anomaly: 2025-02 completion was 72.88% against a prior 12-month mean of 78.98%, a -6.1 percentage-point difference. This calls for focused historical review, not a current high-risk conclusion or causation claim.",
        "zh": "历史月度记录中有一处五点异常：2025-02按计划完成航班比例为72.88%，此前12个月平均为78.98%，相差-6.1个百分点。这需要进行针对性的历史复核，而不是得出当前高风险结论或归因判断。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "OPS-GAO-2025-02"
      ],
      "metricIds": [
        "OPS-GAO-2025-02:completion",
        "OPS-GAO-2025-02:historical",
        "OPS-GAO-2025-02:delta"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The 2025 annual scale record shows low airline business importance at this airport; that affects prioritization, not the weather risk itself.",
        "zh": "2025年年度规模记录显示该机场的航空公司业务重要程度为低；这影响优先级安排，而不改变天气风险本身。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "SCALE-GAO-2025"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The supplied human review rejects the original broad verification-first recommendation and asks first for one consolidated airport support-capability confirmation, its source update time, and unresolved resource categories. This assessment adopts that sequence and preserves the original rejection record.",
        "zh": "提供的人工复核否定了原先宽泛的“先核实”建议，要求首先取得一份综合的机场保障能力确认、其来源更新时间以及尚未确认的资源类别。本评估采纳该顺序，并保留原否决记录。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "RULE006"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The supported risk is medium, not high; no stop condition is active and no separate professional decision is required for this assessment. Any cancellation, release, dispatch, maintenance, or compensation question must still go to the accountable professional.",
        "zh": "支持的风险为中等而非高风险；当前没有触发停止条件，本评估也不要求另行作出专业决定。任何取消、放行、调度、维修或赔付问题仍必须提交相应专业负责人。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "RULE002",
        "RULE005",
        "RULE006"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "If the consolidated confirmation shows de-icing, ground-handling, wind-limit, or staffing constraints, the risk picture may change; this has not been established.",
        "zh": "如果综合确认显示除冰、地面保障、风速限制或人员配置存在约束，风险状况可能变化；目前尚未确认。"
      },
      "kind": "assumption",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:EVT005-0",
        "RULE002"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    }
  ],
  "possibleImpacts": [
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Low temperature and relatively high wind could increase de-icing, ground-handling, or turnaround workload if confirmed; no specific impact is currently confirmed.",
        "zh": "低温和较大风速若得到确认，可能增加除冰、地面保障或过站工作量；目前没有确认的具体影响。"
      },
      "kind": "assumption",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:EVT005-0",
        "RULE002"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Flight-specific operational status may remain unconfirmed; passengers should rely on official airline and airport updates rather than internal speculation.",
        "zh": "具体航班运行状态可能仍未确认；旅客应依赖航空公司或机场的官方更新，而不是内部推测。"
      },
      "kind": "unknown",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "EVT005",
        "RULE005"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The 2025-02 monthly anomaly is the only five-point anomaly in the supplied 24-month record and should be reviewed as winter background, not treated as current causation.",
        "zh": "2025-02月度异常是所提供24个月记录中唯一的五点异常，应作为冬季背景进行复核，不应视为当前事件的归因。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "OPS-GAO-2025-02"
      ],
      "metricIds": [
        "OPS-GAO-2025-02:completion",
        "OPS-GAO-2025-02:historical",
        "OPS-GAO-2025-02:delta"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Low airline business importance may reduce commercial priority but does not establish safety or operational impact.",
        "zh": "航空公司业务重要程度低可能降低商业优先级，但并不证明安全或运行影响。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": [
        "SCALE-GAO-2025"
      ],
      "metricIds": []
    }
  ],
  "assumptionsToVerify": [
    {
      "en": "The operations lead's rejection is based on current resource information that has not yet been supplied.",
      "zh": "运营人员的否决基于尚未提供的当前资源信息。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Airport coordination can provide a single consolidated confirmation for the stated evening period.",
      "zh": "机场协调方能够针对所述晚间时段提供一份综合确认。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Low temperature and relatively high wind may matter for de-icing or ground handling, but no specific limit or impact is confirmed.",
      "zh": "低温和较大风速可能影响除冰或地面保障，但尚未确认具体限制或影响。"
    },
    {
      "en": "No independent current report exists; the single usable report is not corroborated.",
      "zh": "不存在独立的当前报告；唯一可用报告未得到交叉印证。"
    },
    {
      "en": "The 2025-02 historical anomaly is unrelated to this evening's conditions unless later evidence shows otherwise.",
      "zh": "除非后续证据表明有关，2025-02历史异常与今晚情况无关。"
    }
  ],
  "informationGaps": [
    {
      "en": "Consolidated airport support-capability confirmation and its source update time.",
      "zh": "综合的机场保障能力确认及其来源更新时间。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Which resource categories remain unconfirmed, especially de-icing, ground handling, runway wind limits, and stands or gates.",
      "zh": "哪些资源类别仍未确认，尤其是除冰、地面保障、跑道风速限制以及机位或登机口。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Official operational status and any formal airline or airport decision.",
      "zh": "正式运行状态以及任何航空公司或机场的正式决定。"
    },
    {
      "en": "The documented basis for the operations lead's assessment that current resources and local conditions are sufficient.",
      "zh": "运营人员认为当前资源和现场情况足够的书面依据。"
    },
    {
      "en": "The weather observation time, trend, and whether any specific operating limit is exceeded.",
      "zh": "天气观测时间、趋势，以及是否超过任何具体运行限制。"
    },
    {
      "en": "An independent second current report or verification source.",
      "zh": "独立的第二份当前报告或核实来源。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Any flight-specific passenger impact, delay, or cancellation status.",
      "zh": "任何具体航班对旅客的影响、延误或取消状态。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Whether a focused historical review of the 2025-02 anomaly has already been completed.",
      "zh": "是否已完成对2025-02异常的针对性历史复核。"
    }
  ],
  "firstAction": {
    "id": "first",
    "kind": "prepare_information",
    "text": {
      "en": "SIMULATION / 模拟 — DRAFT / 草案. Before broader monitoring, prepare one consolidated information request to airport coordination for GAO for 第6天晚上20:00: ask for a single support-capability confirmation covering de-icing, ground-handling staffing and equipment, runway condition and wind limits, and stand or gate availability; require the source update time and a list of resource categories still unconfirmed. Do not treat the response as confirmed until recorded, and do not direct any operational decision.",
      "zh": "SIMULATION / 模拟 — DRAFT / 草案。在扩大监测范围前，先为GAO第6天晚上20:00准备一份提交机场协调方的综合信息请求：请对方就除冰、地面保障人员与设备、跑道状况与风速限制、机位或登机口可用性提供一份保障能力确认；要求说明来源更新时间并列出仍未确认的资源类别。记录前不得视为已确认，也不得据此指挥任何运行决定。"
    },
