      "kind": "prepare_draft",
      "text": {
        "en": "Prepare a prioritized operations checklist for human review: consolidated support confirmation, source update time, de-icing and ground handling, runway wind limits, stands or gates, the rejection basis, and the 2025-02 anomaly as a separate historical item.",
        "zh": "为人工复核准备一份有优先顺序的运行检查清单：综合保障确认、来源更新时间、除冰与地面保障、跑道风速限制、机位或登机口、否决依据，以及作为独立历史事项的2025-02异常。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": [
        "REPORT:EVT005-0",
        "EVT005",
        "OPS-GAO-2025-02",
        "RULE002",
        "RULE006"
      ],
      "ruleIds": [
