      "zh": "决定是否需要对2025-02异常开展针对性历史复核。"
    }
  ],
  "drafts": {
    "operations": {
      "text": {
        "en": "SIMULATION / 模拟 — DRAFT / 草案. Prioritized checks for operations lead review: (1) obtain the single consolidated airport support-capability confirmation and its source update time; (2) list unresolved resource categories, especially de-icing, ground handling, runway wind limits, and stands or gates; (3) confirm the official weather observation time and trend, and confirm that official operational status remains unconfirmed unless updated; (4) record the rejection reason and preserve the original recommendation; (5) keep the 2025-02 historical anomaly in a separate historical review, not as current causation. Refer any cancellation, release, dispatch, maintenance, or compensation decision to the accountable professional.",
        "zh": "SIMULATION / 模拟 — DRAFT / 草案。供运营负责人复核的优先检查事项：（1）取得一份综合的机场保障能力确认及其来源更新时间；（2）列出尚未确认的资源类别，尤其是除冰、地面保障、跑道风速限制以及机位或登机口；（3）确认官方天气观测时间和趋势，并确认除非有更新，正式运行状态仍未确认；（4）记录否决原因并保留原建议；（5）将2025-02历史异常保留在独立历史复核中，不作为当前归因。任何取消、放行、调度、维修或赔付决定均提交相应专业负责人。"
      },
