    "airportCoordination": {
      "text": {
        "en": "SIMULATION / 模拟 — DRAFT / 草案. Request for GAO, 第6天晚上20:00: please provide one consolidated confirmation of airport support capability for this period, covering (1) de-icing capacity and queues, (2) ground-handling staffing and equipment, (3) runway condition and any crosswind or wind limits in effect, and (4) stand or gate availability and constraints. Include the source update time and state which of these resource categories remain unconfirmed. Scope is the stated evening period only. This is an information request, not a request for an airline operational decision.",
        "zh": "SIMULATION / 模拟 — DRAFT / 草案。针对GAO第6天晚上20:00：请就该时段提供一份综合的机场保障能力确认，涵盖（1）除冰能力与排队情况，（2）地面保障人员与设备，（3）跑道状况及任何正在生效的侧风或风速限制，（4）机位或登机口可用性与约束。请说明来源更新时间，并指出上述资源类别中哪些仍未确认。范围仅限所述晚间时段。本请求为信息请求，并非要求作出航空公司运行决定。"
      },
