        "en": "SIMULATION / 模拟 — DRAFT / 草案. Public facts for the simulated evening period: a scenario report describes low temperature and relatively high wind speed at the airport. Official operational status is not confirmed in the supplied information, and no delay or cancellation is confirmed by this assessment. Please check official airline and airport channels for your flight status. This draft is not a formal notification.",
        "zh": "SIMULATION / 模拟 — DRAFT / 草案。模拟晚间时段的公开事实：一份模拟报告称机场出现低温并伴有较大风速。所提供信息未确认正式运行状态，本评估也未确认任何延误或取消。请通过航空公司或机场官方渠道查询您的航班状态。本草案不是正式通知。"
